     MOVE 0 TO WS-DARKEN
     MOVE 1 TO WS-THUNDER
     CALL "MS6-LOCAL-LIGHT" USING WS-SKY WS-BLOCK WS-DARKEN WS-THUNDER WS-LOCAL
     MOVE "acceptance US15 18§6.8 Light gates: thundering reduces the sky part by 10 (15 -> 5)" TO WS-CASE
