     MOVE 0 TO WS-PEACEFUL
     MOVE 0 TO WS-DARK
     MOVE 1 TO WS-BRIGHT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-VALID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-GRASS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SEES
